{"synopsis":"Dia menyelamatkan masa depan dengan kembali ke masa lalu!\n\nRansen, pangeran terakhir Kerajaan vanroa yang hancur akibat invasi Kekaisaran, berangkat ke tanah asing yang jauh bersama anak-anak para pengikutnya.\n\nBerjuang untuk bertahan hidup, ia akhirnya menjadi seorang swordmaster di usia muda.\n\nNamun, setelah insiden tak terduga, ia kehilangan kekuatannya dan orang-orang di sekitarnya terancam bahaya…\n\nUntuk bertahan hidup, ia menggunakan relik kuno untuk melakukan perjalanan waktu sepuluh ribu tahun ke masa lalu, di mana ia memperoleh keberuntungan misterius dan kembali ke masa kini untuk mengatasi krisis.\n\nNamun, bahaya terus berulang, memaksanya melakukan perjalanan waktu berulang kali.\n\nDi tengah semua itu, rahasia-rahasia mengagumkan yang terkait dengan masa kini mulai terungkap satu per satu.","alternative_title":"시간을 달리는 소드마스터","author":"Studio Innus, Today Too","artist":"Studio Innus","chapters":[{"chapter_id":"0a5b2c42-96b9-4c38-8166-2116b48bc710","number":"35","chapter":"35","title":"","date":"2026-04-10","released":"2026-04-10"},{"chapter_id":"84fba4b4-3f5f-4889-bd41-74c8c614125e","number":"34","chapter":"34","title":"","date":"2026-03-29","released":"2026-03-29"},{"chapter_id":"6f9d0b9f-4274-48cc-9510-1709473003f6","number":"33","chapter":"33","title":"","date":"2026-03-28","released":"2026-03-28"},{"chapter_id":"ae71ffab-78ed-4548-b20b-66983625bad4","number":"32","chapter":"32","title":"","date":"2026-03-28","released":"2026-03-28"},{"chapter_id":"91ec1a59-98e6-4636-ad98-693a5e4598e6","number":"31","chapter":"31","title":"","date":"2026-03-28","released":"2026-03-28"},{"chapter_id":"e94bdbd6-2ac1-4d54-ac3b-03876af56f1b","number":"30","chapter":"30","title":"","date":"2026-02-07","released":"2026-02-07"},{"chapter_id":"79093d55-f633-48aa-92c6-054d5f8d6031","number":"29","chapter":"29","title":"","date":"2026-02-03","released":"2026-02-03"},{"chapter_id":"fa20d9da-70db-41e0-8ece-c4782f44bc55","number":"28","chapter":"28","title":